			"Message": "feat(Output): Add ISearchService to pre-resolved workbench services\n\nExtend the ExposeWorkbenchAccessor ESBuild transform to expose the ISearchService alongside the existing Statusbar, Commands, and CommandRegistry services.\n\nThis adds a require for `vs/workbench/services/search/common/search` and includes a `Search` entry in the `__CEL_SERVICES__` global object, allowing Sky-side bridge code to access the search service directly without re-entering the workbench's AMD loader.\n\nThe search service is now available at `globalThis.__CEL_SERVICES__.Search` for direct method surface access from the Land editor UI.",
